  "description": "The Beyond+ Midtail is a tough, adventure-ready midtail cargo bike built for bikepacking and heavy hauling. Its suspension corrected chromoly frame features a robust, quadruple butted downtube with reinforced wall thickness at the headtube junction, ensuring strength where it matters most. The matching Seido BPS chromoly steel fork is also suspension corrected and equipped with triple cage mounts, making it ideal for hauling the gear needed for long range trips. A Shimano Deore 12-speed drivetrain with a wide range 10 – 51 T cassette gives you all the gearing you need for loaded climbs and rough remote routes. Powerful Shimano Deore hydraulic brakes, with four pistons in the front and two in the rear, deliver maximum braking control. Rolling on tubeless-ready Seido Magnon i35 rims and Maxxis Rekon 29” x 2.6” tires, the Beyond+ Midtail is built to go further - fully loaded.",
